44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, you are right. The daily friction is real. But without named owners, that friction just accumulates. We cannot fund a solution that has no one to maintain it.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
